Usage: nohup COMMAND [ARG]...

Run a command immune to hangups.
Run COMMAND, ignoring hangup signals. If standard output is a terminal,
append output to 'nohup.out'. If standard error is a terminal, redirect
it to standard output. To save output to FILE, use 'nohup COMMAND > FILE'.

OPTIONS:
                 command to run
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
